    U3.vccio_0 U3.vccio_1 U3.vccio_2 U3.vccio_3 U3.vccio_3_2 U3.vcc_spi U3.vpp_2v5
    C14.p1 C15.p1 C16.p1 C17.p1 C18.p1 C19.p1 C20.p1
    U4.vcc C24.p1 R32.p1 R33.p1 R30.p1 R31.p1
    X1.vcc X1.oe C23.p1
    Q1.g Q2.g R11.p1 R12.p1 R20.p1
